 void EditVariables(){using(var f=FeatureForm("Premenné polia",1050,520)){var table=new DataGridView{Dock=DockStyle.Fill,AutoGenerateColumns=false,AllowUserToAddRows=true,AllowUserToDeleteRows=true,AutoSizeColumnsMode=DataGridViewAutoSizeColumnsMode.AllCells};
  string[] names={"Názov","Typ (Number/Date/Fixed)","Začiatok","Krok","Číslice","Prefix","Suffix","Formát dátumu","Posun dní","Posun mesiacov","Pevný dátum","Dátum","Pevná hodnota"};for(int i=0;i<names.Length;i++){if(i==1){var types=new List<VariableTypeChoice>{new VariableTypeChoice{Key="Number",Name=Loc.T("Číslovanie")},new VariableTypeChoice{Key="Date",Name=Loc.T("Dátum")},new VariableTypeChoice{Key="Fixed",Name=Loc.T("Pevný text")}};table.Columns.Add(new DataGridViewComboBoxColumn{HeaderText=Loc.T("Typ"),DataSource=types,DisplayMember="Name",ValueMember="Key"});}else if(i==10)table.Columns.Add(new DataGridViewCheckBoxColumn{HeaderText=Loc.T(names[i])});else table.Columns.Add(names[i],Loc.T(names[i]));}table.DefaultValuesNeeded+=delegate(object sender,DataGridViewRowEventArgs e){object[] defaults={"serial","Number",1,1,6,"","","yyyy-MM-dd",0,0,false,DateTime.Today.ToString("yyyy-MM-dd"),""};for(int i=0;i<defaults.Length;i++)e.Row.Cells[i].Value=defaults[i];};
  foreach(var v in variables)table.Rows.Add(v.Name,v.Type,v.Start,v.Step,v.Digits,v.Prefix,v.Suffix,v.Format,v.Days,v.Months,v.FixedDate,v.Date.ToString("yyyy-MM-dd"),v.FixedValue);
  f.Controls.Add(table);var footer=new FlowLayoutPanel{Dock=DockStyle.Bottom,AutoSize=true};footer.Controls.Add(new Label{Text=Loc.T("Použitie v texte alebo kóde: {serial}. Typ: Number, Date alebo Fixed."),AutoSize=true});footer.Controls.Add(Btn(Loc.T("Použiť"),delegate{try{table.EndEdit();var list=new List<VariableField>();foreach(DataGridViewRow r in table.Rows){if(r.IsNewRow)continue;Func<int,string,string> get=(i,fallback)=>string.IsNullOrEmpty(Convert.ToString(r.Cells[i].Value))?fallback:Convert.ToString(r.Cells[i].Value);list.Add(new VariableField{Name=get(0,"serial"),Type=get(1,"Number"),Start=long.Parse(get(2,"1")),Step=long.Parse(get(3,"1")),Digits=int.Parse(get(4,"6")),Prefix=get(5,""),Suffix=get(6,""),Format=get(7,"yyyy-MM-dd"),Days=int.Parse(get(8,"0")),Months=int.Parse(get(9,"0")),FixedDate=bool.Parse(get(10,"false")),Date=DateTime.ParseExact(get(11,DateTime.Today.ToString("yyyy-MM-dd")),"yyyy-MM-dd",System.Globalization.CultureInfo.InvariantCulture),FixedValue=get(12,"")});}var test=Read();test.Variables=list;BatchData.Variables(test,0,DateTime.Now);ChangeDocument(s=>s.Variables=list);f.Close();}catch(Exception ex){Error(ex);}}));f.Controls.Add(footer);ApplyColors(f);f.ShowDialog(this);}}
 void ExportJob(OutputPlan plan,double dpiValue,string preferred=null){var seen=new HashSet<LabelSettings>();var warnings=new List<string>();foreach(var placement in plan.Placements)if(seen.Add(placement.Label))foreach(var issue in LabelChecks.Inspect(placement.Label)){if(issue.Blocking)throw new InvalidOperationException(issue.ToString());if(!warnings.Contains(issue.ToString()))warnings.Add(issue.ToString());}if(warnings.Count>0&&UiMessageBox.Show(this,string.Join("\r\n",warnings.ToArray())+Loc.T("\r\n\r\nPokračovať v exporte?"),Loc.T("Kontrola etikety"),MessageBoxButtons.YesNo,MessageBoxIcon.Warning)!=DialogResult.Yes)return;using(var d=new SaveFileDialog{Filter="PDF|*.pdf|Word|*.docx|"+(plan.PageCount>1?"SVG (ZIP)|*.zip":"SVG|*.svg")+"|ZPL|*.zpl",FilterIndex=Math.Max(1,Array.IndexOf(new[]{"pdf","docx","svg","zpl"},preferred)+1),FileName="ND-LabelDesigner"})if(d.ShowDialog(this)==DialogResult.OK){string format=new[]{"pdf","docx","svg","zpl"}[d.FilterIndex-1];string path=d.FileName;Atomic(path,p=>JobOutput.Export(p,format,plan,dpiValue));status.Text=Loc.T("Export uložený: ")+path;}}
 void ShowBatch(){var setup=ProjectXml.Decode<BatchSetup>(ProjectXml.Encode(batchSetup));using(var f=FeatureForm("Dávka a premenné",1100,750)){var root=new TableLayoutPanel{Dock=DockStyle.Fill,RowCount=3,ColumnCount=2};root.ColumnStyles.Add(new ColumnStyle(SizeType.Percent,55));root.ColumnStyles.Add(new ColumnStyle(SizeType.Percent,45));root.RowStyles.Add(new RowStyle(SizeType.AutoSize));root.RowStyles.Add(new RowStyle(SizeType.Percent,100));root.RowStyles.Add(new RowStyle(SizeType.AutoSize));f.Controls.Add(root);
  var toolbar=new FlowLayoutPanel{Dock=DockStyle.Fill,AutoSize=true};root.Controls.Add(toolbar,0,0);root.SetColumnSpan(toolbar,2);var sheetChoice=new ModernComboBox{DropDownStyle=ComboBoxStyle.DropDownList,Width=160};var header=new CheckBox{Text=Loc.T("Prvý riadok je hlavička"),Checked=setup.Header,AutoSize=true};var separator=new ModernComboBox{DropDownStyle=ComboBoxStyle.DropDownList,Width=80};separator.Items.AddRange(new object[]{";",",","Tab"});separator.SelectedIndex=setup.Separator=='\t'?2:setup.Separator==','?1:0;var encoding=new ModernComboBox{DropDownStyle=ComboBoxStyle.DropDownList,Width=100};encoding.Items.AddRange(new object[]{"UTF-8","Windows-1250"});encoding.SelectedIndex=setup.CodePage==1250?1:0;var generated=new NumericUpDown{Minimum=1,Maximum=10000,Value=Math.Min(10000,Math.Max(1,setup.GeneratedCount)),Width=75};
  var left=new SplitContainer{Dock=DockStyle.Fill,Orientation=Orientation.Horizontal,SplitterDistance=200};root.Controls.Add(left,0,1);var mapping=new DataGridView{Dock=DockStyle.Fill,AllowUserToAddRows=false,AllowUserToDeleteRows=false,AutoSizeColumnsMode=DataGridViewAutoSizeColumnsMode.Fill};mapping.Columns.Add("target",Loc.T("Prvok"));mapping.Columns[0].ReadOnly=true;mapping.Columns.Add(new DataGridViewComboBoxColumn{Name="column",HeaderText=Loc.T("Stĺpec")});left.Panel1.Controls.Add(mapping);
  var records=new DataGridView{Dock=DockStyle.Fill,AllowUserToAddRows=false,AllowUserToDeleteRows=false,SelectionMode=DataGridViewSelectionMode.FullRowSelect,MultiSelect=false,AutoSizeColumnsMode=DataGridViewAutoSizeColumnsMode.Fill};records.Columns.Add(new DataGridViewCheckBoxColumn{Name="include",HeaderText=Loc.T("Zahrnúť")});records.Columns.Add("row",Loc.T("Riadok"));records.Columns.Add("count",Loc.T("Počet etikiet"));records.Columns.Add("error",Loc.T("Chyba"));for(int i=1;i<4;i++)records.Columns[i].ReadOnly=true;left.Panel2.Controls.Add(records);
  var view=new PictureBox{Dock=DockStyle.Fill,SizeMode=PictureBoxSizeMode.Zoom,BackColor=Color.White};root.Controls.Add(view,1,1);var actions=new FlowLayoutPanel{Dock=DockStyle.Fill,AutoSize=true};root.Controls.Add(actions,0,2);root.SetColumnSpan(actions,2);
  var tables=new List<DataTableSource>();var batch=new List<BatchRecord>();var targets=new List<string>();DateTime instant=currentTime();string csvPath=null;var preparedInfo=new Label{AutoSize=true,MaximumSize=new Size(400,0)};toolbar.Controls.Add(preparedInfo);
  Action clear=delegate{preparedInfo.Text="";batch.Clear();records.Rows.Clear();var old=view.Image;view.Image=null;if(old!=null)old.Dispose();};
  Action map=delegate{clear();mapping.Rows.Clear();targets.Clear();generated.Enabled=tables.Count==0;var table=sheetChoice.SelectedIndex>=0&&sheetChoice.SelectedIndex<tables.Count?tables[sheetChoice.SelectedIndex]:null;var choices=new List<string>{Loc.T("Neprepojené")};int columns=0;if(table!=null)foreach(var row in table.Rows)columns=Math.Max(columns,row.Length);for(int i=0;i<columns;i++)choices.Add((i+1)+": "+(header.Checked&&table.Rows.Count>0?BatchData.Value(table.Rows[0],i):Loc.T("Stĺpec")));var col=(DataGridViewComboBoxColumn)mapping.Columns[1];col.Items.Clear();col.Items.AddRange(choices.ToArray());Action<string,string> add=(key,name)=>{targets.Add(key);var saved=setup.Bindings.Find(b=>b.Target==key);int column=key=="quantity"?setup.QuantityColumn:saved==null?-1:saved.Column;mapping.Rows.Add(name,choices[Math.Max(0,Math.Min(choices.Count-1,column+1))]);};var s=Read();if(!s.HideBarcode)add("code",Loc.T("Čiarový kód"));for(int i=0;i<s.Texts.Count;i++)add("text:"+i,s.Texts[i].Text);for(int i=0;i<s.Symbols.Count;i++)if(s.Symbols[i].Code!=null||s.Symbols[i].Matrix!=null)add("symbol:"+i,s.Symbols[i].Name+" "+(i+1));add("quantity",Loc.T("Počet etikiet"));};
  Action load=delegate{try{using(var d=new OpenFileDialog{Filter="CSV / Excel|*.csv;*.xlsx"})if(d.ShowDialog(f)==DialogResult.OK){tables.Clear();csvPath=null;if(Path.GetExtension(d.FileName).Equals(".csv",StringComparison.OrdinalIgnoreCase)){csvPath=d.FileName;tables.Add(BatchData.Csv(csvPath,separator.SelectedIndex==2?'\t':separator.Text[0],encoding.SelectedIndex==0?65001:1250));}else tables.AddRange(BatchData.Xlsx(d.FileName));sheetChoice.Items.Clear();foreach(var t in tables)sheetChoice.Items.Add(t.Name);if(tables.Count>0){int selected=tables.FindIndex(t=>t.Name==setup.SheetName);sheetChoice.SelectedIndex=Math.Max(0,selected);}map();}}catch(Exception ex){Error(ex);}};
  toolbar.Controls.Add(Btn(Loc.T("Import CSV / XLSX"),load));toolbar.Controls.Add(separator);toolbar.Controls.Add(encoding);toolbar.Controls.Add(sheetChoice);toolbar.Controls.Add(header);toolbar.Controls.Add(Btn(Loc.T("Premenné polia"),delegate{EditVariables();map();}));toolbar.Controls.Add(new Label{Text=Loc.T("Počet záznamov"),AutoSize=true,Margin=new Padding(3,8,3,0)});toolbar.Controls.Add(generated);
  Action generate=delegate{try{mapping.EndEdit();clear();var bindings=new List<ColumnBinding>();int quantity=-1;for(int i=0;i<mapping.Rows.Count;i++){var col=(DataGridViewComboBoxColumn)mapping.Columns[1];int n=col.Items.IndexOf(mapping.Rows[i].Cells[1].Value)-1;if(targets[i]=="quantity")quantity=n;else bindings.Add(new ColumnBinding{Target=targets[i],Column=n});}setup.Bindings=bindings;setup.QuantityColumn=quantity;setup.Header=header.Checked;setup.Separator=separator.SelectedIndex==2?'\t':separator.Text[0];setup.CodePage=encoding.SelectedIndex==0?65001:1250;setup.GeneratedCount=(int)generated.Value;setup.SheetName=sheetChoice.Text;ChangeDocument(d=>d.Batch=setup);var s=Read();var table=sheetChoice.SelectedIndex>=0&&sheetChoice.SelectedIndex<tables.Count?tables[sheetChoice.SelectedIndex]:null;int start=table!=null&&header.Checked?1:0;int count=table==null?(int)generated.Value:table.Rows.Count-start;instant=currentTime();preparedInfo.Text=Loc.T("Údaje pripravené")+": "+instant.ToString("g");for(int i=0;i<count;i++){var r=BatchData.Record(s,table==null?new string[0]:table.Rows[start+i],bindings,quantity,i,start+i+1,instant);batch.Add(r);records.Rows.Add(true,r.Row,r.Count,r.Error??Loc.T("Pripravené"));}}catch(Exception ex){Error(ex);}};
  toolbar.Controls.Add(Btn(Loc.T("Pripraviť dávku"),generate));sheetChoice.SelectedIndexChanged+=delegate{map();};header.CheckedChanged+=delegate{map();};mapping.CellValueChanged+=delegate{clear();};generated.ValueChanged+=delegate{clear();};
  EventHandler reload=delegate{if(csvPath==null)return;try{var t=BatchData.Csv(csvPath,separator.SelectedIndex==2?'\t':separator.Text[0],encoding.SelectedIndex==0?65001:1250);tables.Clear();tables.Add(t);map();}catch(Exception ex){clear();Error(ex);}};separator.SelectedIndexChanged+=reload;encoding.SelectedIndexChanged+=reload;
  records.SelectionChanged+=delegate{var old=view.Image;view.Image=null;if(old!=null)old.Dispose();int i=records.CurrentCell==null?-1:records.CurrentCell.RowIndex;if(i<0||i>=batch.Count||batch[i].Label==null)return;try{using(var scene=VectorArt.Build(batch[i].Label))view.Image=JobOutput.Raster(scene,Math.Min(150,batch[i].Label.Dpi));}catch(Exception ex){records.Rows[i].Cells[3].Value=ex.Message;}};
  Func<OutputPlan> plan=delegate{records.EndEdit();var selected=new List<BatchRecord>();for(int i=0;i<batch.Count;i++)if(Convert.ToBoolean(records.Rows[i].Cells[0].Value))selected.Add(batch[i]);return OutputPlan.Create(selected,Read());};
  actions.Controls.Add(Btn(Loc.T("Vybrať všetko"),delegate{foreach(DataGridViewRow r in records.Rows)r.Cells[0].Value=true;}));actions.Controls.Add(Btn(Loc.T("Zrušiť výber"),delegate{foreach(DataGridViewRow r in records.Rows)r.Cells[0].Value=false;}));actions.Controls.Add(Btn(Loc.T("Exportovať vybrané"),delegate{try{ExportJob(plan(),Read().Dpi);}catch(Exception ex){Error(ex);}}));actions.Controls.Add(Btn(Loc.T("Tlačiť vybrané"),delegate{try{using(var window=CreateJobPrintWindow(Read(),plan()))window.ShowDialog(f);}catch(Exception ex){Error(ex);}}));ApplyColors(f);map();f.ShowDialog(this);clear();
 }}
